# Illidan's native checks by parity: Eye Beam (2026-10-28), #128 Immolate, #147 Fel Rush, #279 Wing Dive.
# Illidan a against Illidan b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
#! chat -dev quick hero illidan
# Eye Beam: the beam hits a standing b and makes it flinch.
60 a tap X 2
# A second beam: b's full jump starts a frame after the fast beam lands.
200 a tap X 2
232 b tap B 8
# Both dash in, about 75 apart.
300 b stick -1 0
302 b stick 0 0
310 a stick 1 0
312 a stick 0 0
# #147: a Fel Rush into b's held shield stops short.
330 b shield 1
340 a stick 1 0
340 a tap X 2
341 a stick 0 0
420 b shield 0
# A rush toward b stopped short by a second special press on its third travel frame.
470 a stick 1 0
470 a tap X 2
471 a stick 0 0
492 a tap X 2
# A full-length rush back through b.
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
570 a release VIEW
600 a stick -1 0
600 a tap X 2
601 a stick 0 0
# #128: Immolate cancelled by a jump on its 6th frame.
720 a stick 0 -1
720 a tap X 2
721 a stick 0 0
725 a tap B 6
# #279: turn left, jump, Wing Ascent, the stick held forward and down on its 17th frame backflips into a forward-down dive, with no special press.
800 a stick -0.5 0
804 a stick 0 0
840 a tap B 6
847 a stick 0 1
847 a tap X 2
848 a stick 0 0
